// P3G.1 (intro-to-drawings.md D13.1, X14 version references; external-references.md ER1.1,
// ER1.7, ER3.5): drawing views of a version stay as they were when the workspace changes; views
// of the workspace go out of date and update. On "Block versions" (`linked-block versions`:
// the Part Studio "Block", 50 × 30 × 25, and an assembly), with document A "Block source" (its
// own V1) in the store for the Other documents tab.
// 01 the Block studio, 25 high; V1 made from the top bar's Create version.
// 02 the workspace edited: Extrude 1 25 → 40 (`linked-block height 40`); the versions counter 1.
// 03 + → Create Drawing → OK: the Insert view browser, Current document, "Block versions" and
//    "Main", with Create version and the Version graph buttons; Other documents is available.
// 04 (ER1.7) the Version graph: Main (selected), V1, Start.
// 05 V1 picked: "↳ V1", the studio's part as it was at V1.
// 06 its Front view following the cursor: 50 × 25.
// 07 placed (left) and, from Insert view again at Main, the workspace's Front view placed (right):
//    50 × 25 and 50 × 40 side by side.
// 08 (D13.1) the workspace edited again, 40 → 60 (`linked-block height 60`): back in the drawing
//    nothing moved, the Update icon is gold (the workspace view is out of date; the V1 view is
//    not).
// 09 Ctrl+Q (Update): the workspace view grows to 50 × 60; the V1 view is still 50 × 25.
// 10 (ER1.1) Insert view → Other documents: the locations.
// 11 My documents: Block source (V1), Block consumer and Block copy (no versions).
// 12 Block source opened at "↳ V1" (another document's studio).
// 12b (P3G.2 judge) its Front view following the cursor with the Insert view card: "Part 1 (V1)".
// 13 its view placed under the others: a third 50 × 25 view, of document A's V1.
// 14 the Sheets pane: the sheet's reference and each view of a version names it ("V1"); the
//    workspace view has no version.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("linked-block"),
        Custom("linked-block versions"),
        Key("F"),
        Click(ui("document-create-version")),
        WaitFor("create-version-dialog"),
        Click(ui("create-version-create")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-studio-v1-made"),
        Custom("linked-block height 40"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-workspace-40"),
        Click(ui("insert-tab")),
        WaitFor("create-drawing"),
        Click(ui("create-drawing")),
        WaitFor("create-drawing-dialog"),
        Click(ui("template-filter-1")),
        Click(ui("template-row-ANSI_A_MM.dwt")),
        Click(ui("create-drawing-ok")),
        WaitFor("insert-view-dialog"),
        Hover(ui("insert-view-version")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("03-insert-view-current-document"),
        Click(ui("insert-view-version")),
        WaitFor("insert-view-graph"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-version-graph"),
        Click(ui("insert-view-graph-node-1")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-at-v1"),
        Click(ui("browser-part-1-1")),
        MoveWorld(105, 140),
        Wait(30),
        MoveWorld(105, 140.5),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("06-v1-view-follows"),
        ClickWorld(105, 140.5),
        Key("Escape"),
        Click(ui("drawing-insert-view")),
        WaitFor("insert-view-dialog"),
        Click(ui("browser-part-1-1")),
        MoveWorld(185, 140),
        Wait(30),
        MoveWorld(185, 140.5),
        Wait(10),
        ClickWorld(185, 140.5),
        Key("Escape"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("07-v1-and-workspace-views"),
        Custom("linked-block height 60"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("drawing-update")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("08-workspace-view-out-of-date"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Key("Ctrl+Q"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("09-updated-v1-view-unchanged"),
        Click(ui("drawing-insert-view")),
        WaitFor("insert-view-dialog"),
        Click(ui("insert-view-source-tabs-1")),
        WaitFor("insert-view-other-loc-mine"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-other-documents-locations"),
        Click(ui("insert-view-other-loc-mine")),
        WaitFor("insert-view-other-doc-block-source"),
        Screenshot("11-my-documents"),
        Click(ui("insert-view-other-doc-block-source")),
        WaitFor("insert-view-other-header"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("12-block-source-v1"),
        Click(ui("browser-part-1-1")),
        MoveWorld(60, 70),
        Wait(30),
        MoveWorld(60, 70.5),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("12b-other-document-view-card"),
        ClickWorld(60, 70.5),
        Key("Escape"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("13-other-document-view"),
        Click(ui("drawing-sheets-toggle")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("14-sheets-pane-versions"),
    ],
)
